#   only when a cost increase is genuinely intended.
test/perf/scale-wall-baseline.json           -merge

# Regenerate: `just update-coverage-floor`
#   (COVERAGE_UPDATE_FLOORS=1 node .github/scripts/coverage-summary.mjs, reading
#    the cover-merged.out `just coverage` leaves behind — needs libchdb.so so the
#    chdb lane is in the profile). One `"<package>": <percent>` line per package:
#    a blend pairs no key with the wrong value, but it can silently carry a
#    LOWERED floor across from a branch that had regenerated after a drop, and a
#    floor that quietly fell is exactly the regression the gate exists to catch.
test/coverage-floor.json                     -merge

